$('#prepareGrid').innerHTML=cards.map(([num,title,body])=>{const id=title==='安全'||title==='Safety'?'safety':'';const src=prepSrc[num];return `<article class="prepare-card gplace" ${id?'id="'+id+'"':''}><span>${num}</span><h2>${title}</h2><p>${body}</p><p><a class="v4-source" data-keep-link="1" href="${src[0]}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${src[1]}</a> · ${src[2]}</p></article>`;}).join('')+ (zh?`<article class="prepare-card gplace" id="driving"><span>08</span><h2>第一次在新西兰开车</h2><p>靠左行驶。海外驾照通常可以短期使用，但有的国家需要认可的英文翻译。取车时核对保险是否覆盖碎石路。细节以 NZTA 页面为准。</p><p><a class="v4-source" data-keep-link="1" href="https://nzta.govt.nz/travelling-on-our-roads/visitors-and-new-residents/driving-on-nz-roads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NZTA 访客开车说明</a> · 2026-11-13</p></article><article class="prepare-card gplace" id="campervan"><span>09</span><h2>房车</h2><p>坐渡轮的车辆要按运营商要求提前检票。车上的 LPG 属于危险品，出发前看 Interislander 的危险品说明，气瓶要关掉。自由露营不是到处都能停；保护地营地按 DOC 规则预订和付费。</p><p><a class="v4-source" data-keep-link="1" href="https://www.interislander.co.nz/plan/dangerous-goods" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Interislander 危险品说明</a> · 2026-11-13 · <a class="v4-source" data-keep-link="1" href="https://www.doc.govt.nz/parks-and-recreation/places-to-stay/stay-at-a-campsite/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOC 营地</a> · 2026-11-12</p></article>`:`<article class="prepare-card gplace" id="driving"><span>08</span><h2>First time driving here</h2><p>Keep left. An overseas licence can be used for a short visit; some countries need an approved English translation. At pick-up, ask whether cover includes gravel roads. The NZTA page is the rule.</p><p><a class="v4-source" data-keep-link="1" href="https://nzta.govt.nz/travelling-on-our-roads/visitors-and-new-residents/driving-on-nz-roads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NZTA driving on NZ roads</a> · 2026-11-13</p></article><article class="prepare-card gplace" id="campervan"><span>09</span><h2>Campervan</h2><p>A vehicle on the ferry checks in on the operator’s clock. LPG counts as dangerous goods: read Interislander’s page and turn cylinders off. Freedom camping is not allowed everywhere. On conservation land, use DOC campsites and their fees.</p><p><a class="v4-source" data-keep-link="1" href="https://www.interislander.co.nz/plan/dangerous-goods" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Interislander dangerous goods</a> · 2026-11-13 · <a class="v4-source" data-keep-link="1" href="https://www.doc.govt.nz/parks-and-recreation/places-to-stay/stay-at-a-campsite/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOC campsites</a> · 2026-11-12</p></article>`);
